      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Volga River runs along Wadena’s southern edge, offering a quiet waterway that locals use for fishing and paddling.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wadena%2C_Iowa",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Every October, Wadena residents and visitors gather at the historic Lima Church for the annual Lima Leaf Day fall festival.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
