      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Fayette County, home to Wadena, features many historic bridges that are part of the Barn Quilt Route, a scenic trail for cyclists.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
